---
title: "Figure 3.X. Admin Side Process Flow"
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Admin Opens DermaTrack]
    B --> C[Login]
    C --> D{Are credentials\nvalid?}

    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[System Checks User Role]
    E --> F{Is the user role\nAdmin?}

    F -- No --> G[Deny Access]
    G --> Z1([End])

    F -- Yes --> H[Open Admin Dashboard]
    H --> I[Admin Selects\nManagement Function]

    I --> J[Manage User Accounts]
    J --> K{Does an account require\nactivation or deactivation?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Update Account Status]
    L --> M[Review User Roles]
    K -- No --> M

    M --> N{Is role\ncorrection needed?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Update Role Setting]
    O --> P[Review Messaging Controls]
    N -- No --> P

    P --> Q{Is messaging\nrestriction needed?}
    Q -- Yes --> R[Apply or Remove\nMessaging Restriction]
    R --> S[Review Audit Logs]
    Q -- No --> S

    S --> T{Does an issue require\nadministrative review?}
    T -- No --> U[Record Review Action\nin Audit Log\n&#40;if applicable&#41;]
    U --> Z2([End])

    T -- Yes --> V[Evaluate Issue]
    V --> W{Is break-glass\naccess justified?}

    W -- No --> X[Deny Break-Glass Access]
    X --> Y[Record Denial\nin Audit Log]
    Y --> Z3([End])

    W -- Yes --> BG1[Grant Break-Glass Access]
    BG1 --> BG2[Set Reason, Duration,\nRead-Only Status,\nGranted Time, Expiry Time,\nand Revocation Status]
    BG2 --> BG3[System Records Admin Action\nin Audit Log]
    BG3 --> BG4{Has break-glass access\nexpired or been revoked?}

    BG4 -- Yes --> BG5[Revoke or Mark\nSession Expired]
    BG5 --> BG6[Update Audit Log]
    BG6 --> Z4([End])

    BG4 -- No --> BG7[Maintain Access\nUntil Expiry Only]
    BG7 --> Z5([End])

    style A fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z1 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z2 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z3 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z4 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z5 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style D fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style F fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style K fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style N fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style Q fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style T fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style W fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style BG4 fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
